direction: down
map: "Public map invokes proc\ncurrent input / pending results / caller state"
capture: "Capture k inside callback\nstack-backed frame chain + denv\nowned stack/segment and code lifetime"
publish: "Publish k through an admitted root\nroot adoption + stabilization/scan debt"
cut: "Acknowledged minor or stabilization cut\nfreeze roots, capture writers and affected readers"
mature: "Materialize / promote once per dynamic identity\ncomplete bodies and all edge/forwarding work\nshared nonmoving mature frames"
map -> capture
capture -> publish
publish -> cut
cut -> mature
original: "Original map returns list A\nk and saved graph can remain reachable"
mature -> original
minor: "Later minor GC\nactive roots + remembered dirty sources\nunchanged mature saved graph skips full traversal"
major: "Major GC\nretained root values + mature graph tracing\nscan/mutation coordination + closing cut"
original -> minor
original -> major
restore: "Repeated invocation of k\nconsistent source view + rooted winding stages\nexecution-frame copies and active-root handoff"
minor -> restore
major -> restore
results: "Resume callback / map construction\npreserve earlier returned list A\nsaved source remains reusable"
restore -> results
mutate: "Explicit frame / denv / cursor mutation\npreserve aliases, typed layout and slot\nyoung remembering + major protection"
original -> mutate
mutate -> minor: "recorded dirty source"
mutate -> major: "admitted access and mark work"
